    "body": "## What and why\n\nDecompose the corrected donor candidate’s earliest residual from retained native scores and finite feature incidence. This tests why the #2073 journal offered no target winner, without a new fit or model replay.\n\n## Result\n\nKEEP saved decomposition; NOT YET PROMOTED as a learning change. At #2069 input245/conditional position7 (target324 vs307), all4096 Generate+16physicalCopy atom masses reproduce the saved native pool. Target Copy801100048+Generate222793 loses to rival Copy2147483648+Generate391014. One alias each, no clipping, distinct eight-key Prefix incidences, nonsaturated codes. Fourteen accepted helpful adjacent changes improve the local contrast3.5nats but leave16543477 Q24 Copy deficit. This supports a new coordinated finite-update question, not protected feasibility, capacity or a language gain. Accepted8/512 and conditional9/15 remain unchanged.\n\nOne diagnostic schema failure is retained: both bank heads/actions already include Cue/Prefix. Repaired source and freshattempt2 pass; Source-only contributions are explicitly derived subtraction. No model/gradient/proposal/Gscore regeneration or paid compute. Complete failed+successful roots and source are freshly downloaded/member-verified in iCloud; all4roots pass normative verification.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Exact-head checks posted: wording, AST, diff whitespace, SHA identities and4native sealed roots. No Rust/model path changed; model retests inapplicable.\n- [x] Research record docs/labs/residual-pool-competition-2026-10-09/README.md\n- [x] Newest-first current-state entry ending in Next\n- [x] Stale-doc search retained; previous question completed and earlier different-artifact diagnosis distinguished\n- [x] STATUS/ROADMAP/#2028 position unchanged:8/512, gate9/15; scoped result to M2\n- [x] README capability/mechanism unchanged, no log entry\n- [x] Claim-wording gate passes\n- [x] After merge: verify freshmain, delete branch/worktree, hygiene and result comment\n\nReferences #2030\n",
